          "id": "6d4f6384-ef80-46c5-910d-4ccb81e30691",
          "name": "Create a New Webhook Subscription",
          "request": {
            "name": "Create a New Webhook Subscription",
            "description": {
              "content": "Create a new webhook subscription. Before creating a webhook, ensure that a signature key has been created.\n\nFor the example \"Create Webhook using oAuth with Client Credentials\" - for clients who have more than one oAuth Provider and have different client secrets that they would like to config for a given webhook, they may do so by overriding the keyId inside security config of webhook subscription.\nSee the Developer Center examples section titled \"Webhook Security - Create or Store Egress Symmetric Key - Store oAuth Credentials For Symmetric Key\" to store these oAuth credentials that CYBS will need for oAuth.\n\nFor JWT authentication, attach your oAuth details to the webhook subscription. See the example \"Create Webhook using oAuth with JWT\"\n",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "notification-subscriptions",
                "v2",
                "webhooks"
              ],
